ar filtration rate in diabetic nephropathy from age, body weight and serum creatinine</article-title><source>Diabetes Care</source><year>1992</year><volume>15</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>609</fpage><lpage>612</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/diacare.15.5.609</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1516478</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Rigalleau</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lasseur</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Perlemoine</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Barthe</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Raffaitin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Chauveau</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Baillet-Blanco</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Beauvieux</surname><given-names>M-C</given-names></name><name><surname>Combe</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gin</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><article-title>Estimation of glomerular filtration rate in diabetic subjects: Cockcroft formula or modification of Diet in Renal Disease study equation?</article-title><source>Diabetes Care</source><year>2005</year><volume>28</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>838</fpage><lpage>843</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/diacare.28.4.838</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15793182</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B20"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Rigalleau</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lasseur</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Perlemoine</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Barthe</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Raffaitin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Chauveau</surname><given-name